"puedes crear una gratis: https://eduid.se/\n"

#: src/edusign_webapp/templates/invitation_email.html.jinja2:45
#: src/edusign_webapp/templates/invitation_email.txt.jinja2:25
msgid ""
"\n"
"You are invited to sign this document with a \"High\" assurance level (AL3). "
"Not all systems support AL3/ \"High\" assurance level. If you encounter "
"issues with this in your system, please ask the sender to re-send the "
"document with a \"Medium\" or \"Low\" assurance level.\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/edusign_webapp/templates/invitation_email.html.jinja2:52
#: src/edusign_webapp/templates/invitation_email.txt.jinja2:30
msgid ""
"\n"
"If you experience problems with this service contact the local IT-department "
"at the organisation that invited you to sign. If you are unsure how to do "
"that please reach out to the person who invited you.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Si experimentas problemas con este servicio ponte en contacto con el "
"departamento de TI de la organización desde la que se te invitó a firmar. Si "
"no estás seguro ponte en contacto con la persona que te invitó.\n"

